    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Most of the in-game content were translated by generative ai, so if you feel it is not appropriate, welcome to contact with me by email or through the community.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A young boy chosen by destiny embarks on a mission to purify the five sacred stones. He traverses treacherous mountains and desolate deserts, facing the unknown and his own fears. Along the journey, while battling dark forces, he uncovers the secrets hidden within the world. Each adventure strengthens his resolve, ultimately leading him to the pivotal moment that will change the fate of the world.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic ATB (Active Time Battle) Combat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging in dynamic battles where time flows continuously. Make real-time strategic decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalizing your character\u2019s appearance. Create a hero that reflects your personality and stand out in the world of adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Skill Learning and Casting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning and cast any skill without restrictions.  Experiment with countless skill combinations to create your ultimate playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling lonely on your journey? Head to the Adventurers\u2019 Guild to recruit companions! You can even switch party members depending on the challenges ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Attribute Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain attribute points as you level up and allocate them freely to enhance your character\u2019s stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trial Tower</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Trial Tower, a specially designed area where adventurers can safely battle monsters to gain experience, gold. Even if you failed in battle, the game will not end instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Quests and Hidden Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with diverse quests, ranging from epic main storylines to heartfelt side stories. Discover hidden caves, finding the hidden lore or treasures in the game.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Most of the in-game content were translated by generative ai, so if you feel it is not appropriate, welcome to contact with me by email or through the community.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A young boy chosen by destiny embarks on a mission to purify the five sacred stones. He traverses treacherous mountains and desolate deserts, facing the unknown and his own fears. Along the journey, while battling dark forces, he uncovers the secrets hidden within the world. Each adventure strengthens his resolve, ultimately leading him to the pivotal moment that will change the fate of the world.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic ATB (Active Time Battle) Combat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging in dynamic battles where time flows continuously. Make real-time strategic decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalizing your character\u2019s appearance. Create a hero that reflects your personality and stand out in the world of adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Skill Learning and Casting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning and cast any skill without restrictions.  Experiment with countless skill combinations to create your ultimate playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling lonely on your journey? Head to the Adventurers\u2019 Guild to recruit companions! You can even switch party members depending on the challenges ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Attribute Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain attribute points as you level up and allocate them freely to enhance your character\u2019s stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trial Tower</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Trial Tower, a specially designed area where adventurers can safely battle monsters to gain experience, gold. Even if you failed in battle, the game will not end instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Quests and Hidden Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with diverse quests, ranging from epic main storylines to heartfelt side stories. Discover hidden caves, finding the hidden lore or treasures in the game.</p></li></ul>",
